      "title": "Model and Usage Guide",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Krea 2 Turbo Text-to-Image\n\n## How to use\n\n1. Edit \"Krea2 Prompt\".\n2. Choose a moodboard in \"Krea Moodboard Visual Browser\".\n3. Set the aspect ratio and target megapixels in \"Krea2 Resolution Selector\".\n4. Use the LoRA Switch to enable or bypass the workflow's LoRA branch. You can reselect model files to match your local installation.\n5. Queue the workflow.\n\n## Before running\n\n- Diffusion model: a Krea 2 Turbo checkpoint in ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/.\n- Text encoder: ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors.\n- VAE: ComfyUI/models/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors.\n- LoRAs referenced by the workflow are stored in ComfyUI/models/loras/.\n- Install ComfyUI-Krea2-Harness and a moodboard node package that provides Krea Moodboard Visual Browser.\n\nIf a loader shows a missing model, select a compatible file installed on your machine.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# Krea 2 Turbo Text-to-Image\n\n## How to use\n\n1. Edit \"Krea2 Prompt\".\n2. Choose a moodboard in \"Krea Moodboard Visual Browser\".\n3. Set the aspect ratio and target megapixels in \"Krea2 Resolution Selector\".\n4. Use the LoRA Switch to enable or bypass the workflow's LoRA branch. You can reselect model files to match your local installation.\n5. Queue the workflow.\n\n## Before running\n\n- Diffusion model: a Krea 2 Turbo checkpoint in ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/.\n- Text encoder: ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors.\n- VAE: ComfyUI/models/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors.\n- LoRAs referenced by the workflow are stored in ComfyUI/models/loras/.\n- Install ComfyUI-Krea2-Harness and a moodboard node package that provides Krea Moodboard Visual Browser.\n\nIf a loader shows a missing model, select a compatible file installed on your machine.\n"
      },
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
